## GitHub Integration

```python
from code_reviewer.github import GitHubPRReviewer

async def review_pr():
    reviewer = GitHubPRReviewer(token="ghp_...")
    result = await reviewer.review_pr("owner/repo", 123)
    await reviewer.post_review("owner/repo", 123, result)
```

