## Configuration

### Environment Variables

```bash
# AI Provider
export OPENAI_API_KEY="sk-..."

# GitHub Integration
export GITHUB_TOKEN="ghp_..."

# Telegram Bot
export TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN="your-bot-token"
```

